<title>USA: Walt Disney Co Q4 Sept 30 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Walt Disney Co Q4 Sept 30 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>BURBANK, Calif. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.52		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net			 354,000		  221,000</p>
<p> Revs		    5,272,000		4,690,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  685,000		  687,000</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			   $1.96		    $1.94</p>
<p> Net		     1,350,000		1,326,000</p>
<p> Revs		   21,238,000	     18,949,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  689,000		  685,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are pro forma and assume ABC was acquired at beginning of 1995. Actual shr is $0.49 vs $0.50 for Q4 and $1.96 vs $2.60 for year.</p>
<p>Year 1996 pro forma and actual net includes $300 million accoutnign charge.</p>
<p>Year 1996 actual net includes $225 million acquisition-related costs.</p>
</text>
